The stubhub SQLite seed (instance_seed/stubhub.db) is deterministically generated at
image build time by running seed_data.py against the tracked source_data/
snapshots (PYTHONHASHSEED=0, frozen MIRROR_NOW 2026-09-26). Do not commit
instance_seed/ for this site; see the Dockerfile stanza and
scripts/check_seed_databases.py --allow-build-generated.
